# RadioGroup on DemoPage

## Source of truth
- Every sample is a real `RadioGroup` call. Labels and options come from `t()`.
- The Show Code is the full `<RadioGroup>` a developer pastes, including `version`, `label`, `labelClass`, `radioLabelClass`, and the real options.
- Publish immediate and schedule use the same group. Show it once. ShowCode names both `socialMode` and `socialMode2`.
- PlanSharing / LuckyDraw attach-media share that same dashboard look — do not demo them as extra samples.

## Do not demo
- Invented options (Choice A / B / C) or a `multiple` prop. `RadioGroup` does not take `multiple`.
- A “selected” readout that no page renders.
- Duplicate Attach Media rows (publish + plan + lucky draw).
